fe569f","event_uuid":"bda4d881-634e-4206-ae99-8b5e85f1bf49","position":{"commit_sha":"72e290dad4c31e6b49235adc2f714c7c4ffe3da0","position":"1788215118888072120-bda4d881-634e-4206-ae99-8b5e85f1bf49"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":null},{"content_hash":"45e61d6a056d9b97962bb136d7200ac084014d5f52d90f8d07bbb54ef4967390","event_uuid":"127daa2c-dbef-453f-98a1-80909f01103d","position":{"commit_sha":"72e290dad4c31e6b49235adc2f714c7c4ffe3da0","position":"1788215118902793953-127daa2c-dbef-453f-98a1-80909f01103d"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":null},{"content_hash":"7b3cd4bcf5a5e357f50453d893aba18d05b47dae711135c7ab680e50d7a72167","event_uuid":"fdbf4471-2a8d-4df4-baa7-ae77527f7e31","position":{"commit_sha":"5031d0d2724c403912dbbc4dbd84bd20dbbb9ba9","position":"1788215273827030265-fdbf4471-2a8d-4df4-baa7-ae77527f7e31"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":null}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[{"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Progress (worktree fix-enrich-producer @ origin/main 8db37393): plan-review certified (PASS, ~2 min), ticket claimed. RED-first regression test added (tests/unit/test_enrich_queue.py::test_cert_with_drain_off_appends_no_queue_event — failed pre-fix, asserts no *-ENQUEUE_ENRICH.json file at all). Fix: sign_plan_review now gates the enqueue on compose_config(repo_root).verify.suggest_duplicate_tickets AND resolve_gate_config(repo_root).overlap_drain != \"off\" — the exact pair enrich_drain.maybe_drain reads, no new config surface. rebar.toml: suggest_duplicate_tickets = false + both comment blocks corrected. test_cert_enqueues updated to enable the feature explicitly (keeps proving drain-on enqueue unchanged). make lint / typecheck / config-check / verify-gate-parity / gen_env_registry --check all green. Commit 3c1b1d7f1680 (Change-Id Ib94d00017ab5ade75b91473dfbed01909baadb6c). Full default suite running; will push to Gerrit on green.","timestamp":1788215273827030265}],"created_at":1788214657591162795,"creation_channel":"mcp","deps":[{"link_uuid":"63c53c9b-5b5e-45b2-b3de-2719de20c325","relation":"relates_to","target_id":"59a7-cb88-f2f9-4148"}],"description":"## Problem\n\n`overlap_drain = \"off\"` (rebar.toml:209, landed 08-28 via 2dbdcc8abe2c) disables the enrichment drain, but the PRODUCER side still runs: every plan-review certification unconditionally appends an `ENQUEUE_ENRICH` event to the tickets store (`src/rebar/llm/plan_review/attest.py:216-225` — best-effort `_enqueue_queue.enqueue(...)` with no config check), and `suggest_duplicate_tickets = true` (rebar.toml:40) keeps the advisory overlap feature nominally on.\n\nEvidence: 95 `ENQUEUE_ENRICH` commits appended to the tickets branch in the last 2 days with the drainer off — durable store writes into a queue nothing consumes. Each is a git commit + push on the shared store (the project's top fragility surface; see `.scratch/stability-analysis/E1-store-prototype.md` §enrich and `06-plan.md` A.0.2).\n\n## Fix shape\n\nGuard the certification-time enqueue on the same effective config that governs the drain, so producer and consumer cannot disagree; and set `suggest_duplicate_tickets = false` for this project. Historical queue events stay untouched (read-only history; no backlog drain, no deletion). Read the config through the standard config path (must pass `scripts/check_config_reads.py`).\n\n## Acceptance criteria\n\n- [ ] With `overlap_drain = \"off\"`, a plan-review certification appends NO `ENQUEUE_ENRICH` event (regression test proves it: certify against a throwaway store with drain off, assert no queue event file/commit is produced).\n- [ ] With the drain enabled, enqueue behavior is unchanged (existing tests still pass).\n- [ ] `rebar.toml` for this project sets `suggest_duplicate_tickets = false`, with the adjacent comment block (rebar.toml:38, :207) updated so the two settings no longer claim the advisory overlap stays on.\n- [ ] No existing `ENQUEUE_ENRICH`/`CLAIM_ENRICH`/`DONE_ENRICH` events are modified or deleted.\n- [ ] No new config key, env var, lock, or guard mechanism is introduced (use the existing `overlap_drain` / `suggest_duplicate_tickets` reads).\n\n## File impact\n\n- src/rebar/llm/plan_review/attest.py — guard the certification-time enqueue on the effective overlap config\n- rebar.toml — suggest_duplicate_tickets = false + comment correction\n- tests: one regression test for \"certification with drain off appends no queue event\" (extend the existing queue/attest test module rather than adding a new file)","env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","file_impact":[{"path":"src/rebar/llm/plan_review/attest.py","reason":"guard certification-time enqueue on effective overlap config"},{"path":"rebar.toml","reason":"suggest_duplicate_tickets = false + comment correction"},{"path":"tests/unit/test_overlap_queue.py","reason":"regression test: certification with drain off appends no queue event (or the module where queue/attest tests live)"}],"file_impact_scope":"paths","keyring":[],"last_status_env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","managed_refs":[["relates_to","59a7-cb88-f2f9-4148"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"bda4d881-634e-4206-ae99-8b5e85f1bf49","plan_review_phase":"execution","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"repos":["rebar"],"reverts":[],"status":"in_progress","tags":[],"ticket_id":"4eae-c207-7d7b-41f3","ticket_type":"bug","title":"Enrich producer still appends ENQUEUE_ENRICH to the store while overlap_drain is off","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["e28d2ab9-863c-4030-8d37-12ce99afa2b5","67400e5d-9b01-4dd7-88eb-209a601df943","63c53c9b-5b5e-45b2-b3de-2719de20c325","6891fb73-d589-4f0e-86d8-14b013d59fa8","bda4d881-634e-4206-ae99-8b5e85f1bf49","127daa2c-dbef-453f-98a1-80909f01103d","fdbf4471-2a8d-4df4-baa7-ae77527f7e31"]},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1788215273827030266,"uuid":"1be93d24-b250-47bd-b397-f16b1646ef03"}